Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.01,2:02:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《钢铁侠3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(1999年 瑞士 伯尔尼)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(新年前夕)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(你知道我是谁)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(现在 加利福尼亚 马利布)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(珮珀 圣诞快乐)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(加利福利亚州 圣拉斐尔 1310°)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(密苏里州 斯普林菲尔德 870°)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(田纳西州 玫瑰山 3000°)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:09.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(塔格特·J)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.73,1:02:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(任务执行期失踪人员)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.48,1:13:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(佛罗里达州 迈阿密)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有位名人曾说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A famous man once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们创造自己的魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We create our own demons."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话谁说的 是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said that? What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是照着说罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said it cause he said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最先说这话的已然成名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, now, he was famous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再算上我 即两个名人都说过了这话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's basically getting said by two well-known guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从头再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't...I'm going to start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那从源头说起好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's track this from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 哟 你们听 这有一个故事 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo listen up here's a story ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 一个活在蓝色世界的小人物 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ About a little guy that lives in a blue world ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 白天晚上 他所见之处 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And all day and all night and everything he sees ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 都只是蓝色 像他一样里外全是蓝色 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Is just blue like him inside and outside ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 蓝色的房带一扇蓝色的小窗 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Blue is his house with a blue little window ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 还有辆蓝色汽车 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And a blue Corvette ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:55.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 对他来说都是蓝色 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And everything is blue for him and himself ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 对他来说都是蓝色 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And everything is blue for him and himself ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:57.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 所有人都是蓝色 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And everybody around ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:00:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 所有人都是蓝色 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And everybody around ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 但没有人要听他说 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ 'Cause he ain't got nobody ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 但没有人要听他说 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ 'Cause he ain't got nobody... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舞会还有半个小时结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half-hour 'till the ball drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:11.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼·斯塔克 你的演讲真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark, great speech man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我演讲了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave a speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那演讲如何 - 受益匪浅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How was it?  - Edifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晦涩难懂 - 是吗？ 好评差评尽入囊中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unintelligible.  - Really? That's my favorite kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢这调调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a winning combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们干啥去 - 去进城找乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, uh, where are we going? - Uh, to town on each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:21.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许会去你那儿 看看你的研究成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably back at your house. I want to see your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让你看研究 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you can see my research, but that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不打算让你看我的"下面"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to show you my "Town".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯塔克先生 我是胡英森 - 还真有人起名荡"货"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Stark, Ho Yinsen.  - Oh, I finally met a man called "Ho".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为您介绍下我们的客人 吴医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to introduce you to our guest, Doctor Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 吴医生 - 这位是斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh this guy.  - Mr. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 - 你是个心脏科医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello  - You're a heart doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一会就急需看心脏病专家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going to need a cardiologist after I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 下次再聊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye!  - Perhaps another time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切始于1999年瑞士的伯尔尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It started in Bern, Switzerland, 1999.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想当年啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没想过会翻起这些陈年旧账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought they'd come back to bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要旧事重提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好托尼 我是阿尔德里奇·基里安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Tony! Aldrich Killian,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:01:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢你做的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a big fan of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的粉丝吗？ - 他谁啊 他是说喜欢我的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My work? - Who is he? He means me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然也喜欢您 但汉森小姐 我的组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, of course, but Miss Hansen my organization
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自你在麻省理工第二学年起就关注你的研究了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been tracking your research since year two of M.I.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦还是来了 让他给挤进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh wow, he made it. He made the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 你去哪一层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What floor you are going to, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得恰到好处啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well now, that is an appropriate question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去底层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ground floor, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我创办的公司一样 刚起步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a proposal I'm putting together myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是由私人投资的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a privately-funded
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,智囊团 叫"高级点子机构"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think tank called "Advanced Idea Mechanics".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两张都给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she'll take both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会扔一张留一张 就不给你打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One to throw away and one to not call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"高级点子机构" 简称AIM(专注) 懂了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Advanced Idea Mechanics" Or AIM for short, you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然 你T恤上不是也有么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that 'cause it's on your T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟着大背头走 女士优先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies, follow the mullet. Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我会打你电话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得跟你共事会很爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am titillated by the notion of working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗 - 等我把这些人甩开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?  - I'll ditch these clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后楼顶见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you up on the roof in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我先去喝一杯润润嗓子 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just going to try to get my beef wet real quick.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂我意思吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you know what I'm talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会儿见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见不散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是吧 还以为这只是理论 - 曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, I thought that was just a theory. - Well... it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我的推论没错 大脑修复中枢可被进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm right, we can access the area of the brain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并通过化学手段被重新编码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that governs repair and chemically recode it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太牛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简单地说 你像黑客一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Essentially, you're hacking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑掉了一个生命体的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the genetic operating system of a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 操作系统是吧 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- living organism.  - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可不可以别碰我的植物 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you not touch my plant?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不… 她不喜欢这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not... she doesn't like it. She perfers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和其它植物不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:10.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走 我们去卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go to the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮 别动她的榕属植物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, leave her ficus alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 由植物实验着手证明推论吗 - 暂时是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're starting with plants?  - For now, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我称它为"终极改造"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling it "Extremis".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 其实这可以　- 可以运用于人体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, its... - Human application.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的  可以深层激活人体潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly! Exactly! Dentra-degree vitalization.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预防疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disease prevention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至断肢再生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even limb regrowth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见到过最有才华的女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the most gifted woman I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是吧 - 仅限于瑞士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow!  - In Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:36.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 听起来靠谱多了 - 仅限于本周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's better.  - This week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才差点就信了对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost bought it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说嘛 这个技术还有点小毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I'm talking about, the glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你检查过末端酶修复算法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you checked the telomerase algorithm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们没事 - 躺着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're good.  - Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你压着我了 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right on me. I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的研究出了小毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a glitch in my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像她说的那样 有小毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was just talking about it. Glitches happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是千年虫呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's not Y2K...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 新年快乐 - 新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy New Year.  - Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 明早见 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I'll see you in the morning, Okay? Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧 - 挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You good?  - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我就在外面待着 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be right outside.  - Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.95,0:04:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我为什么会讲这段故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why am I telling you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我制造了魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I had just created demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却毫不自知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I didn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当年纵情声色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, those were good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但时光不再\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在阿富汗某山洞吃了些苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After a brief soiree in an Afghan cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此后戒绝了宴会派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said "Goodbye" To the party scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:04:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也忘了在瑞士的那一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot that night in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也忘了在瑞士的那一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot that night in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今 我脱胎换骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These days I'm a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.85,0:05:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 请允许我先花几小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, please, may I request
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 来调整一下… - 没门儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- just a few hours to calibrate...  - Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微型中继设备植入完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Micro-repeater implanting sequence complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如您所愿 先生 我还准备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish, sir. I've also prepared a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,详尽的安全手册让您来无视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}safety briefing for you to enitrely ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安心 我肯定无视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 来试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨笨 你怎么戴上那顶帽子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Dummy. How did you get that cap on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你很配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在角落里干了什么好事 你自己清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing out of the corner? You know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.49,0:05:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把毯子上的血弄干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood on my mat, handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 您差不多72小时没合眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, may I remind you that you've been awake for nearly 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 女士们 晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus up ladies. Good evening
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临"产房"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And welcome to the birthing suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很荣幸地向你们宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am pleased to announce the imminent arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们牛逼哄哄且生机勃勃的小弟弟就要诞生啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of your bouncing, badass baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启动摄像机开始录像 加时间和日期戳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start titan and go white. Stamp date and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第42代 自动推进附着战衣测试开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark 42 autonomous prehensile propulsion suit test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启动程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initialize sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 来点儿音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, drop my needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 应该没问题了 一起上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I think we got this. Send them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点儿快了 慢点儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably just a little fast, slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:01.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能缓和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow it down just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点点儿么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 让它们安分点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool it, will you Jarvis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不怕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看您工作真是让我一如既往好开心呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As always sir, a great pleasure watching you work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足足3天3夜没怎么休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess 72 hours is a long time between siestas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到情况会越来越糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't think it could get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一打开电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they had to go and turn on the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能看到"他"正抢着新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when 'He' happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说我是恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people call me a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得自己是老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consider myself a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好再上一课吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for another lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1864年 在科罗拉多州的桑德克里克地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 1864 in Sand Creek, Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美军趁着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U.S. Military waited until
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淳朴的夏安族族中勇士都外出打猎时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the friendly Cheyenne Braves had all gone hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伺机屠杀了留守的老幼妇孺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waited to attack and slaughter the families left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并占领了他们的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And claim their land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,39小时前 美驻科威特的阿里艾尔萨勒姆空军基地遭袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}39 hours ago, the Ali Al Salem Air Base in Kuwait was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的军队教堂里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A quaint military church,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挤满了妇女和儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with wives and children of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,士兵都外出演习去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The soliders were out on manuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 "勇士"都不在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "Braves" were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃利斯总统 你一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President Ellis, you continue
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵制我对你的教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to resist my attempts to educate you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在 又想起我了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, you've missed me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁 却不知道我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am. You don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也永远料不到我要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll never see me coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,…信号好像恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and now that we seem to be back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回顾下视频中的恐怖袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's recap some of the frightening developments in this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国航空公司遭到劫持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American airways were hijacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全国高度戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nation remains on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有寻找曼达林的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All attempts to find Mandarin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都宣告无果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have so far proved unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的内阁积极应对此次恐怖事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Central to my administration's response
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并将起用全新人力和物力进行反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to this terrorist event is a newly-minted resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是詹姆斯·罗迪上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know him as Colonel James Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人民很快就会熟知这位钢铁爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American people will soon know him as the Iron Patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃利斯总统就这么应对的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how is President Ellis responding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把以前的"战争机器"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By taking the guy they
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出来重新刷了遍漆而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}call "War Machine" and giving him a paint job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.73,0:10:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是那套战衣 但涂成了红白蓝三色 你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same suit but painted red, white and blue, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后名字变了 叫钢铁爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they've also renamed him Iron Patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以免漆薄了让人认出原形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, just in case the paint was too subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,民意反馈结果还挺好的 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tested well with focus groups, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我竟成了钢铁爱国者 - 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am Iron Patriot. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争机器听着太强势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War Machine was a little too aggressive, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个名字好一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sends a better message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那曼达林到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's really going on? With Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说正经的 能和我说一下这家伙么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, can we talk about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是机密情报 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's classified information, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 有九起爆炸 - 九起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, there've been nine bombings. - Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公众知道的只有三起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The public only knows about three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在问题是 不知道爆炸装置是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here's the thing... nobody can ID a device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现场弹壳都没有 - 我帮得上忙 随时找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's no bomb casings.  - You know I can help. Just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有大堆新发明 有自动附着战衣 还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a ton of new tech. I got a prehensile suit. I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排弹装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bomb disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可在半空拦截弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catches explosions mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多久没睡个好觉了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the last time you got a good night's sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦一年才睡三个小时 成就比我高多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein slept three hours a year. Look what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很担心你 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are concerned about you, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要打感情牌么？ - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gonna come at me like that?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你觉得我是笨-\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not trying to be a dic-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 蛋 - 可以在我的画上签个名么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- tator. - Would you mind signing my drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他不介意就行 你不介意吧 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Richard doesn't mind. You alright with this, Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你叫什么名字？ - 埃琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is your name? - Erin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很像圣诞故事里的男一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you in A Christmas Story, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国防部那帮人害怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the Pentagon is scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纽约事件外星人事件 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After New York, aliens, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们得假装强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to look strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:18.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最要紧的是阻止曼达林 但不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stopping the Mandarin is a priority, but it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最要紧的是阻止曼达林 但不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stopping the Mandarin is a priority, but it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最要紧的是阻止曼达林 但不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stopping the Mandarin is a priority, but it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不关超级英雄的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not superhero business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 确实无关 - 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's not. Quite frankly.  - Get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 这是全国上下所有人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite frankly, it's American business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才说 我… 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I said. I... got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弄断了蜡笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke the crayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗 斯塔克先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay, Mr. Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松点 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy. Tony...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么从虫洞里出来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get out of the wormhole?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 托尼 - 他说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute, Tony.  - What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我得看一下战衣 确保… 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Have to check on the suit... make sure... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查心脏 检查 检查下 是大脑么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the heart, check the, check the, is it the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心脏和大脑都没有异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of cardiac analomy or unusual brain activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我是中毒了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so I was poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的诊断是 您目前有严重的焦虑症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My diagnosis is that you've experienced a severe anxiety attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 这样可不好 快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on man, this isn't a good look. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我先走一步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I gotta split.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胸牌 胸牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badge... Badge...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴胸牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴胸牌啊 洗手间还贴了备忘条呢 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badge, guys. I put a memo in the toliet, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼把它们放在地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony has got them in his basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机器人戴着派对帽 都可以投入使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're wearing party hats, this is an asset we can put to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是么 那你是建议我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh. So, you're suggesting that I replace
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把所有家政人员都换成机器人么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the entire janitorial staff with robots?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说 用人的部分可用机器代替\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm saying is that the human element of Human Resources
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人比机器脆弱得多 也是我们最大的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is our biggest point of vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好马上行动 除去弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should start phasing it out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 抱歉 班比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What!?  - Excuse me, Bambi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你刚那么说了么？ - 安保胸牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you just say that?  - Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮 我为你成了安保部主管感到很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, okay, I am thrilled that you're now the Head of Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个职位非常适合你 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, it is the perfect position for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是 - 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- However... - I do appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你接任以来 - 不用和我说谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Since you've taken the post,  - You don't have to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,员工投诉率升高了300%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had a rise in staff complaints of 300 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 这不是夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - That's not a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"这不是夸奖"？ 这当然是在夸我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"That's not a compliment"? It is a compliment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然某人是在掩饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly somebody is trying to hide something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 打扰一下 - 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀小姐 您约在四点的客人到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Potts, your four o'clock is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四点的约 你和我确认过么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you clear this four o'clock with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮 咱们稍后再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, we'll talk about this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我眼下得去处理一件非常麻烦的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But right now I have to go deal with this very annoying thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.11,0:13:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他共事过 以前就总想和我约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to work with him, and he used to ask me out all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以有点难办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it's a little awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光听就觉得棘手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 珮珀 - 基里安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pepper.  - Killian?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 你 你很帅气啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you, you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我… 我难以… 你之前到底在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, I, I can't...  What on Earth have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing fancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五年都在接受理疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just five years in the hands of physical therapists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 叫我阿尔德里奇就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please, call me Aldrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没领安保胸牌吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you were supposed to be issued a security badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 不会有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes?  - We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定？ - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你先去吧 - 我就在附近 不会走远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand down.  - I'm going to linger. Right here, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真高兴 基里安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very nice to see you, Killian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.01,0:14:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞节快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些年 我的智囊团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After years dodging the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在规避"非道德生物研究"禁令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}president's ban on "Immoral Biotech Research",
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:18.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并研发出了一个小玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my think tank now has a little something in the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命名为"终极改造"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an idea we like to call "Extremis".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:26.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先把灯关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna turn your lights down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请参观人类大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regard the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 不对 这是宇宙 我弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, wait, hold on, hold on, that's, that's the universe, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是人脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿真效果不可思议吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strangely mimetic though, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很神奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 这是我的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:14:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:15:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的是我大脑深处 和实况转播一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... you're inside my head. It's a live feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来 我演示给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on up, I'll prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在掐我胳膊一下 我不怕疼 掐啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, pinch my arm. I can take it. Pinch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.71,0:15:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是初级体感皮层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The primary somatosensory cortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是大脑的痛觉中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the brain's pain center,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这里…这里才是我想给你看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this... is what I wanted to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前 "终极改造"项目正开发人体生物电潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, "Extremis" harnesses our bioelectrical potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并将其送到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it goes... here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这里空间充足 也就是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is essentially an empty slot, and what this tells us is that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的大脑和DNA系统 注定要升级换代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our mind, our entire DNA in fact, is destined to be upgraded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂？ 我是安保头子 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? This is forehead of Security.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别闹 我正经上班呢 你干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, look, I got a real job. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在忙 有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working. I got something going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？ 烦人的实习生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Harassing interns?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你说 如果我告诉别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something, you know what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:15:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己当过钢铁侠的保镖 你知道会怎样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I told people I was Iron Man's bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会大声嘲笑我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would laugh in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我得在脸没丢光前赶快开溜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to leave while I still had a shred of dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我有正经事做 保护珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I got a real job. I'm watching Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了什么事？ 快告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Fill me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你真想知道？ - 当然啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For real?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 她正在和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, so she's meeting up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个高帅富科学家会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with this scientist rich guy, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始我没认出他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't make his face at first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道我认人很厉害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know I'm good with faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 这方面你最强 - 所以我查了他的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh yeah, you're the best. - Yeah, so I run his credentials,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认出他是阿尔德里奇·基里安 我们还见过这家伙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make him. Aldrich Killian. We actually met the guy back in...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1999年科学大会 当时在哪儿来着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were we in '99? The Science Conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃 瑞士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对 就是那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, right, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基里安 我完全没印象啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killian, I don't remember that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然没印象了 他又不是金发大胸女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you don't remember, he's not a blonde with a big rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始还好 他俩在谈正事 可现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first it was fine, they were talking business, but now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气氛很奇怪 他正给珮珀展示他的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's like getting weird. He's showing her his big brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他的什么？ - 大脑 她还挺喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His what? - Big brain, and she likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:40.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看看吧 等一下 看见没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me show you. Hold on. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么？ 看你盯着他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what? You watching them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.61,0:16:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把屏幕转过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flip the screen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就能看到了 - 我没你懂科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and then we can get started.  - I'm not a tech genius like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 赶快过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just trust me, get down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:48.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转下屏幕我就知道怎么回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flip the screen, then I can see what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不知道怎么转屏幕!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to flip the screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对我指手画脚 你已经不是我老板了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to me like that anymore. You're not my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之我不为你工作 而且这哥们很可疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I don't work for you, and I don't trust this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带来的人也鬼鬼祟祟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got another guy with him, he's shifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松 你只需要确保周边安全就可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. I'm just asking you to secure the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他去外面喝杯东西什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to go out for a drink or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗？ 你最好多关心关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? You should take more of an interest in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.47,0:17:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人是你最该珍视的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman is the best thing that ever happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你却总忽视她 - 巨型大脑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're just ignoring her.  - A giant brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 还有一个鬼鬼祟祟的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, there's a giant brain, there's a shifty character...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟踪他 仔细调查他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to follow this guy. I'm going to run his plates
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算闯祸也无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if it gets rough, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想你 哈皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you, Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想你 想念以前的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I miss you too but the way it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:18.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今你和重量级朋友混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're off with the 'superfriends'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道你近况了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what's going on with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界也越来越奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's gettin' weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 打断一下 你带电击枪了吗？ - 干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey I hate to cut you off, do you have your taser on you? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似人事部有个女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's a gal in HR who is trying
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在偷墨盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to steal some printer ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好过去给她一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should probably go over there and zap her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象下 你能黑掉任何生物的硬盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine if you could hack into the hard drive of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:35.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并给它的DNA重新编码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any living organism and recode its DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜 它也极可能运用于武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, to my ears it also sounds highly weaponizable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像超能战士 私军之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in enhanced soldiers, private armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:47.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 托尼不会对这些… - 托尼 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and Tony is not...  - Tony, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我邀请过他 加入AIM\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I invited Tony to join AIM.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,13年前的事了 当时他拒绝了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}13 years ago and he turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可现在不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But something tells me now there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另有天才执掌高位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a new genius on the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不归托尼管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who doesn't have to answer to Tony anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不像他那般自大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who has slightly less of an ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我很想帮你 阿尔德里奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be a no, Aldrich...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是得拒绝你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as much as I'd like to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 我很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't say that I'm not disappointed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就像我父亲说过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as my father used to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"透过失败的迷雾能看到成功的曙光"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Failure is the fog through which we glimpse triumph."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很深奥 我都没听懂什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very deep, and I have no idea what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不明白 我老爸也就是个傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, me meither, he was kind of an idiot, my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还会再见面的 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I'll see you again, Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:42.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车准备好了…随时可以出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car is ready... if you're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 天哪 我忘了我还有点事儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I just um, God, I forgot my other thing so I'm just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起我迟到了 我刚才…你干嘛啊？!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I'm late. I was.. What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家里也穿着它？ 这是第15代吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wearing this in the house now? What is that, like Mark 15?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 差不多 每个人都有自己的爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like that. You know, everybody needs a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:37.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非得穿着它在客厅显摆爱好咯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and you have to wear your hobby in the living room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是穿着习惯一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just breaking it in, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始穿包得有点紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's always a little pinchy in the GUI-bagger at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 看到给你的圣诞礼物没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh hey, did you see your Christmas present?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了 怎么会看不到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I did. I don't know how
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么大的圣诞礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have missed that Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搬得进来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it gonna fit through the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 问得好 我找了一伙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well actually, uh, that's a good question, I got a team of guys
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们明天会过来把这面墙炸掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming tomorrow. They're gonna blow out that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天过得好不好？ 累吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, tense? Good day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:19:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肩膀有点儿紧啊 不乖哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh shoulders, a little naughty. Naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别嫌我啰嗦 只想知道 你喜欢那大兔子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to harp on this, but did you like the custom rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问我喜不喜欢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 超喜欢吧？ - 哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nailed it, right? - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激你的心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate the thought very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不能把面具摘了 吻我一下呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you lift up that facemask and give me a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 打不开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh, yup, damnit. No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你就冲这个缝儿来一口？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to just kiss it on the, uh, facial slit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是去车库看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I run down to the garage and see if
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找撬棍撬开这玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find a crowbar to jimmy that thing open?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撬棍？ 啊别去 那里有辐射泄漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A crowbar? Yeah. Oh, except there's been a radiation leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我愿意冒这个险 - 很危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take my chances.  - That's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好歹穿上生化防护服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least let me get you like a Hazmat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者测完放射指数什么的再去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a Geiger counter or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 被发现了 - 这真是达到了无聊的新境界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Busted.  - This is a new level of lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 - 你约我吃晚饭 却不等我 自己先吃了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - You ate without me, already? On date night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他只是… - 是你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was just. - You mean you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:53.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 是我 我只是想说我们刚刚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well yeah, I just mean we were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一边招待你 一边完成了点工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just hosting you while I finished up a little work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh Huh..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前随便吃了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yes, I had a quick bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:20:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不知道你到底是回家呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know if you were coming home
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是和基里安出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you were having drinks with Aldrich Killian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基里安？ 你监视我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aldrich Killian? What are you checking up on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈皮是关心你 - 不 你在监视我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy was concerned.  - No, you're spying on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去睡觉了 - 等等 别这样 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to bed. - Hold on. Come on. Pep-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认 是我错了 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I admit it! My fault. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a piping hot mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这阵子都这样…还没和人说起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been going on for a while... I haven't said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 从纽约事件起就这样了 - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing's been the same since New York. - Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't notice that, at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历过一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You experience things and then
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情了了 却还是无法讲清始末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're over and you still can't explain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神灵 外星人 其他次元…而我只是藏身铁壳的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gods, aliens, other dimensions... I'm just a man in a can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以还没崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only reason I haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只因为你搬进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cracked up is probably because you've moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这实在太好了 我真幸运 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is great. I love you, I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但亲爱的…我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But honey... I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡了 我就到这里来干干活 修补修补盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go to bed, I come down here. I do what I know, I tinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:03.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威胁逼近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The threat is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须守护最重要的珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have to protect the one thing that I can't live without.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于我的盔甲 它们是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my suits, they're uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 机器 - 它们是我的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Machines. - They're part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.39,0:22:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在转移我注意 - 可能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A distraction.  - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去洗个澡 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna take a shower. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你也一起 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're going to join me. - Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony! Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:15.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关闭电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定是在梦里召唤了它 这一切不该发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have called it in my sleep. That's not supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去重新校对下传感器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll recalibrate the sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以…让我…让我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we just...just let me...just let
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.88,0:23:40.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喘口气 好吗 别走好不好 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me catch my breath, okay? Don't go, alright? Pepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去楼下睡 你一个人修吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to sleep downstairs. Tinker with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你控制的住么 - 我可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you regulate? - Yes, I can regulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.54,0:24:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 确定？ - 确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure about that?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这批货很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a decent batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别说我没关照你 - 多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't say I never did nothing for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.59,0:24:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean for understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're ya doing, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己闲逛呢 还是出来约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You out by yourself? A little date night?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你最爱的肥皂电影么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching your favorite chick flick maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.29,0:25:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 电影名叫"派对结束"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a little movie called "The Party's Over"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.36,0:25:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由你和你嗑药的女友出演 票在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starring you and your junkie girlfriend, and here's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑 这不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding. That doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赛文 救我 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savin! Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.99,0:27:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是关于幸运饼干的真实故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A true story about fortune cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们看着很中式 听着很中式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look Chinese. They sound Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.63,0:27:19.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却的确由美国人发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're actually an American invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.46,0:27:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以饼馅空心 充满了谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why they're hollow, full of lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.43,0:27:27.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道也不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave a bad taste in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的门徒刚摧毁了另一个廉价的美国仿制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My disciples just destroyed another cheap American knock-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.24,0:27:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中国大剧院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chinese Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.83,0:27:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生 我知道这让人消沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. President. I know this must be getting frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.23,0:27:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这一季的恐怖剧目要落幕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this season of terror is drawing to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过别急 重头戏即将开演 你的毕业典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't worry, the big one is coming, your graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.99,0:28:09.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Oh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.11,0:28:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不介意电视开着吧 - 不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind leaving that on? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.99,0:28:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,PBS的周日晚间剧《唐顿庄园》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunday night's PBS, "Downtown Abbey"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.09,0:28:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是部电视剧 他很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the show. He thinks it's elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.83,0:28:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拜托件事 让所有人戴好胸牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing, make sure everyone wears their badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.78,0:28:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他注重细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a stickler for that sort of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.13,0:28:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的人也不会让没胸牌的人进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plus my guys won't let anyone in without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.53,0:28:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在等待托尼·斯塔克的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're awaiting the arrival of Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他能做出回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're hoping he'll give us the reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.10,0:28:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回应最近的一次恐怖袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His reaction to the latest attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.25,0:28:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有消息称 这次袭击也由曼达林策动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our sources are telling us that this is another Mandarin attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.28,0:28:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您还知道其他细节吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else you can tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.02,0:28:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生 什么时候除了这个恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Mr. Stark! When is somebody going to kill this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:28:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们那么想知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.31,0:29:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个小小的节日问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a little Holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.91,0:29:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要送给曼达林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}greeting I've been wanting to send to the Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.47,0:29:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚想好了措辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just didn't know how to phrase it until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.67,0:29:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫托尼·斯塔克 你并不可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Tony Stark and I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.63,0:29:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你不过是懦夫 我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you're a coward, so I've decided
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.57,0:29:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你等着受死吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you just died, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.67,0:29:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会手刃你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna come get the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.61,0:29:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不牵涉政治 我是为了私仇要报复你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no politics here, it's just good old-fashioned revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.85,0:29:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也和国防部无关 是咱俩的私人恩怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no Pentagon. It's just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堂堂正正地较量吧 这是我家的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on the off-chance you're a man, here's my home address:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.35,0:29:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马里布港10880号 邮编90265\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10880, Malibu Port, 90265.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.03,0:29:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敞开门欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave the door unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你满意了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.11,0:29:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我为您编好了曼达林的数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've compiled a Mandarin database for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.45,0:29:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据神盾局 联邦调查局和中情局截获的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drawn from S.H.I.E.L.D., F.B.I. And C.I.A. Intercepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.69,0:29:58.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始虚拟重建犯罪现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiating virtual crimescene reconstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what do we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他被称为幕僚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"His name is an ancient Chinese war mantle"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.83,0:30:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"意思是首领的顾问"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Meaning 'Advisor to the King'."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"南美叛乱策略"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"South American insurgency tactics."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.33,0:30:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"说话口气像浸信会传教士"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Talks like a Baptist preacher."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.79,0:30:17.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里信息太多了 看不过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's lots of pageantry going on here, lots of theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.75,0:30:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 关闭 - 爆炸导致的高温超过了3000℃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Close. - The heat from the blast was in excess of 3000 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.93,0:30:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能迅速蒸发方圆12.5码内的一切东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any subjects within 12.5 yards were vaporized instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.70,0:30:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中国大剧院周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No bomb parts found in a
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.85,0:30:30.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 三英里内没发现任何炸弹残骸 - 对的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 3-mile radius of the Chinese theatre. - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.43,0:30:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 哈皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to me, Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是炸弹的炸弹 是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is a bomb not a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有军人受害么 - 根据公共数据 没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any military victims? - Not according to public records, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再调出温度分布图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the thermogenic signatures again,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.76,0:31:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把3000℃这个因素也考虑进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}factor in 3000 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.33,0:31:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甲骨文云计算已完成分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oracle cloud has completed analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.25,0:31:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始访问卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accessing satellites and plotting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.53,0:31:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绘制出过去12个月的热能事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last 12 months of thermogenic occurances now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排除曼达林袭击过的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take away everywhere that there's been a Mandarin attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.88,0:31:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.85,0:31:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.81,0:31:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定那个不是他干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure that's not one of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.89,0:31:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间上早于任何已知的曼达林袭击事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It predates any known Mandarin attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.60,0:31:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该事件是引爆炸药自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The incident was the use of a bomb to assist a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.91,0:31:51.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热能特征近似 都是3000摄氏度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heat signature is remarkably similar. 3000 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.23,0:31:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是俩个军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's two military guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.21,0:31:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去过田纳西州吗 贾维斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever been to Tennessee, Jarvis?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:32:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备飞去田纳西州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creating a flight plan for Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.11,0:32:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么还有人来敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we still at 'Ding-Dong'?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.21,0:32:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该全副安全防范啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to be on total security lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.95,0:32:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我刚威胁了一个恐怖分子 谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, I threatened a terrorist. Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.25,0:32:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我只能帮到这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only so much I can do, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.43,0:32:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你公布了自家的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you give the world's press your home address.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就站在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.57,0:32:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是曼达林 对吗? 你是么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the Mandarin, are you? Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得我了 我竟然一点也不意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember. Why I am not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只对你这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take it personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连自己早饭吃了什么都不记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember what I had for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 无谷华夫饼干 - 对头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gluten-free waffles, sir. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.86,0:32:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I need to be alone with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.69,0:32:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换个地儿吧 这事很急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someplace not here... it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.06,0:32:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放以前 我会顺势而上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normally, I'd go for that sort of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.85,0:32:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在不会了 我有正式的女朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now I'm in a committed relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.17,0:33:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就…是她 - 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's... with her.  - Tony
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.57,0:33:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有人来了吗？ - 对 玛雅·汉森来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is somebody there?  - Yeah, it's Maya Hansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.20,0:33:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前认识的普通朋友 搞植物学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old botanist pal that I used to know, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会还有个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't tell me that there is a
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.09,0:33:14.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没见过我的12岁小孩在车里等着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}12-year-old kid waiting in the car that I've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.81,0:33:17.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他13了 当然不是 我想请你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's 13. No, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.22,0:33:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛？为嘛现在来找？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What for? Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.18,0:33:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看过报纸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I read the papers, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.71,0:33:22.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 我觉得你撑不过这周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frankly, I don't think you'll last the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会没事的 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be fine.  - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.15,0:33:25.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈皮住院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Happy in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.21,0:33:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我都不知道还会有客人来 - 确实没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't know we were expecting guests.  - We weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 特别是前女友! - 她不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And old girlfriends!  - She's not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是 一夜情而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really. It was just one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.27,0:33:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 你就爱这样说是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yep.  - That's how you did it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.18,0:33:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚挺美妙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a great night
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.00,0:33:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 呃 差不多了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well... you know  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.58,0:33:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好没成事 要不你得后悔死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have saved yourself a world of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.09,0:33:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 啥？ - 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.50,0:33:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要出城了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们什么没经历过 不用出城 - 要出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, we've been through this. Nope.  - Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.25,0:33:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说不去 - 马上就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The man says no.  - Immediately and indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.69,0:33:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好主意 我们走吧 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great idea. Let's go.  - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这主意很糟糕 别动她的包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a terrible idea. Please don't touch her bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.59,0:33:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 这样做才像正常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, this is how normal people behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.41,0:33:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面我可没法保护你 我挑衅了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't protect you out there. I challenged...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.50,0:33:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这正常吗？ - 不好意思 那个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that normal?  - Sadly, that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.43,0:33:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 很正常!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, this is normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.59,0:34:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 非常正常 - 大兔子而已 别大惊小怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's very normal.  - It's a big bunny, relax about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 冷静! - 我专门送你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calm down!  - I got this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.19,0:34:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.44,0:34:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没告诉我你喜不喜欢 我问了你三次…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still haven't even told me that you liked it! I asked you three...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.68,0:34:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不喜欢! - 你不喜欢？!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't like it!  - You don't like it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.65,0:34:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都要出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are leaving the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.69,0:34:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这有什么好争的 - 伙计们 那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- that's not even up for discussion.  - Guys... do we umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 那里没关系吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Do we need to worry about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.30,0:35:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我来保护你 - 我先保护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got you.  - I got you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都说了 咱们不能呆在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, we can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.35,0:35:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧走! 我就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! I'm right behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.45,0:35:24.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住她 我这就找条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her, I'm going to find a way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.34,0:35:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别停下! 带上她 快出去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop stopping! Get her. Get outside! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.76,0:35:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God. Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.75,0:36:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 珮珀已经安全出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Miss Potts is clear of the structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 我的飞行能力呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, where's my flight power?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在弄呢 先生 这只是个样机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working on it, sir. This is a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.80,0:37:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.03,0:37:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 这套战衣还没有进入战斗状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the suit is not combat-ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.35,0:37:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.48,0:38:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.39,0:39:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 深吸一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.76,0:39:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞行能力恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight power restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.48,0:39:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.15,0:39:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 关掉闹钟 我已经醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, kill the alarm. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.38,0:39:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是战衣能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the emergency alert
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.75,0:39:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低于5%的紧急警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}triggered by the power dropping below 5%.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雪了？ 我们这是在哪 北部吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snow? Where are we, upstate?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.81,0:40:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在田纳西州玫瑰山外5英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are 5 miles outside of Rose Hills, Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.42,0:40:42.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.03,0:40:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯! 这可不是我的主意 我们在这干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis! Not my idea! What are we doing here, this is
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.50,0:40:49.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都千里之外了 我得找到珮珀 我得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thousands of miles away? I've gotta get Pepper, I've got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.35,0:40:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是您定的飞行计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prepared a flight plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.73,0:40:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目的地设在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的 打开战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who asked you? Open the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.45,0:40:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像出故障了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I may be malfunctioning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.67,0:40:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open Eject.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.66,0:41:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻快多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's brisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是呆里面舒服一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'll just cozy back up for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.38,0:41:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在得睡觉了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually think I need to sleep now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.75,0:41:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.17,0:41:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我啊 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.23,0:41:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克安全服务器 正在传送所有已知设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark Secure Server: Now transferring to all known receivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.74,0:41:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.22,0:41:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要向你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a lot of apologies
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.09,0:42:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间不多 长话短说吧 首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make and not a lot of time, so first off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.95,0:42:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 让你身处险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I put you in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.63,0:42:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又自私又愚蠢 保证不再有下次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was selfish and stupid and it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.33,0:42:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 圣诞节那只兔子确实太大了 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, it's Christmas time and the rabbit's too big. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.18,0:42:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.63,0:42:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再提前和你说声对不起 因为我还不能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm sorry in advance because... I can't come home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.68,0:42:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得找到那个人 你要注意安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to find this guy. You gotta stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.25,0:42:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚在一个店门口偷了件披风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just stole a poncho from a wooden Indian.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.25,0:42:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来给你整好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.71,0:42:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在开心了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.14,0:43:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.85,0:43:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不许动 - 我投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't move.  - You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.11,0:43:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土豆枪不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice potato gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪筒有点长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barrel's a little long.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.74,0:43:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪筒长口径大 威力会减弱很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between that and the wide gauge, it's going to diminish your FPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.62,0:43:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you're out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.88,0:43:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胸口上的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that thing on your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.69,0:43:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个电磁铁 你应该知道啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a electromagnet. You should know,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.29,0:43:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这有一箱呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've got a box of them right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.09,0:43:37.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用在什么东西上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it power?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.11,0:43:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.01,0:43:56.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个是钢铁侠吗 - 理论上我才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that Iron Man?  - Technically, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.79,0:43:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理论上你已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.25,0:44:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有道理 - 他怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A valid point. - What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.82,0:44:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着呢 我造了他 自然得照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life. I built him. I take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.93,0:44:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会修好他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.01,0:44:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像机械师一样 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like a mechanic.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.32,0:44:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我来造钢铁侠和战争机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was building Iron Man and War Machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.96,0:44:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在叫钢铁爱国者 - 更酷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Iron Patriot now.  - That's way cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.49,0:44:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.88,0:44:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让我来 我会加个反射…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I would have added in the retro...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.40,0:44:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 反射面板？ - 好让他进入隐形模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Retroreflective panels?  - To make him stealth mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.45,0:44:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想要做隐形模式？ - 很酷吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want a stealth mode?  - Cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.75,0:44:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这主意真好 也许我会造个这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's actually a good idea. Maybe I'll build one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.23,0:44:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样可不好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.36,0:44:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干吗？ 你要把他手指掰断么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? You're going to break his finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.63,0:44:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经很痛苦了 都受伤了 别碰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in pain. He's been injured. Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.81,0:44:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 - 是真抱歉么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry.  - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.49,0:44:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要担心 我会修好他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. I'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.79,0:44:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你家都有谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, who's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.62,0:44:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈去餐馆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my mom already left for the diner
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.98,0:44:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸去便利店买彩票了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dad went to 7-11 to get scratchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.77,0:44:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该中了大奖吧 因为都走了六年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he won 'cause that was six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.17,0:44:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸抛弃家庭走了很正常啊 别那么伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which happens, dads leave. No need to be a pussy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.39,0:45:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I need:
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.16,0:45:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一台笔记本电脑 一块数码手表和一部手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A laptop, a digital watch, a cell phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.88,0:45:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你土豆枪里的气压传动装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pneumatic actuator from your bazooka over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.37,0:45:09.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一张地图 一个大弹簧 还有一个金枪鱼三明治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a map of town, a big spring, and a tunafish sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.96,0:45:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你给我啥好处？ - 救你 他叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's in it for me?  - Salvation. What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.23,0:45:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁？ - 在学校欺负你的那个 他叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who?  - The kid that bullies you at school, what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.41,0:45:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.54,0:45:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你看样宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.37,0:45:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是高科技的蛐蛐罐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a pinata for a cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.45,0:45:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逗你玩的 其实是很有威力的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kidding. It's a very powerful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.25,0:45:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离自己脸远一点 对着别人 再按顶上按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point it away from your face, press the button on top,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.48,0:45:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不会有人欺负你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It discourages bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.54,0:45:36.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会死人 只是个自保装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Non-lethal, just to cover one's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.23,0:45:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 成交不成交 你说 - 成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deal. Deal? What'd you say? - Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.13,0:45:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你叫什么名字 - 哈利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name? - Harley
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.91,0:45:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你呢 - 机械工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you are?  - A mechanic,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.11,0:45:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我一直在想什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what keeps going through my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.49,0:45:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的三明治怎么还没来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.72,0:46:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克安全服务器 视网膜扫描已确认身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark Secure Server. Retinal scan verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.34,0:46:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要向你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a lot of apologies to make
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.53,0:46:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间不多 长话短说吧 首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not a lot of time, so first off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.87,0:46:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 让你身处险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I put you in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.56,0:46:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又自私又愚蠢 保证不再有下次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was selfish and stupid and it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.47,0:46:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚为什么来我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why were you at the house tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.16,0:46:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事这么重要 让你非得和托尼谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was so important that you had to speak to Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.32,0:47:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我老板在为曼达林卖命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that my boss is working for the Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想继续谈这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you still want to talk about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.05,0:47:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议找个安全的地方说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest we get ourselves someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老板在为曼达林工作 怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boss works for the Mandarin you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.47,0:47:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼明明说你是植物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Tony says you're a botanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.59,0:47:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也对 我其实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That figures. What I actually am
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.98,0:47:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是生物基因编码人员 负责一个40人团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a biological DNA coder running a team of 40
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.12,0:47:19.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归在私费资助的智囊团名下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of a privately-funded think tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.94,0:47:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 叫我植物学家也没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but sure you can call me a "Botanist".
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.42,0:47:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老板叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This boss of yours, does he have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.43,0:47:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫阿尔德里奇·基里安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Aldrich Killian.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.41,0:47:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把房子掀了个遍 可是没找到尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we took the house down sir, but there's no sign of a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.65,0:47:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道了 - 没找到斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I see.  - No Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.89,0:47:37.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.21,0:47:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大师马上就要录像了 他有一点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Master is about to record and he's a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.48,0:47:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他是什么脾气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you know how he gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.22,0:47:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上你按原计划做 完事了电话通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your appointment tonight and call me when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.17,0:47:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了各位 不许说话 不许有任何眼神交流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright everybody. No talking and no eye contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.63,0:47:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想脸上挨枪子儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you wanna get shot in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.36,0:48:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大师进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Master is travelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.79,0:48:35.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们现在开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.23,0:48:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三明治还不错 弹簧有点生锈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sandwich was fair, the spring was a little rusty,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.90,0:48:43.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其它材料勉强可使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest of the materials I'll make do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.88,0:48:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一句 你说你妹妹有手表时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, when you said your sister had a watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.22,0:48:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没想到是这么个玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was kinda hoping for something a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.30,0:48:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才六岁 这表还是限量版呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's six! Anyway, it's limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.01,0:48:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 能聊聊纽约的事儿吗 - 不能 别老想着这茬儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When can we talk about New York? - Maybe never, relax about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.46,0:48:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那来聊聊复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Avengers,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.37,0:48:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以吗 - 我不确定 再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- can you talk about them? - I don't know. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.69,0:49:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你让我静静好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey kid, give me more space.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.31,0:49:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到底发生了什么事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the official story here? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.92,0:49:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人叫查德·戴维斯 他以前住这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this guy named Chad Davis, used to live roundabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.59,0:49:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在军队中得过很多奖章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won a bunch of medals in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天 大家说他发疯了 他做了炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, folks said he went crazy and made, you know, a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.04,0:49:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿 把自己炸飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he blew himself up right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.37,0:49:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 六人丧生 对吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Six people died, right? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.33,0:49:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 包括他自己 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Including Chad Davis? - Yea.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.87,0:49:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.91,0:49:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想想看 死了六人 可只有五个影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it. Six dead, only five shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.64,0:49:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 人们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but people said these
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.75,0:49:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有影子代表灵魂死后去了天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shadows are like the mark of souls gone to Heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.53,0:49:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而造炸弹的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except the bomb guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.39,0:49:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他进了地狱 所以没有影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he went to Hell on account of he didn't get a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 所以就只有五个 - 你相信这说法么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's why there's only five. - Do you buy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.91,0:50:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what everyone says.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.38,0:50:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这弹坑让我想起了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this crater reminds me of?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我也不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.79,0:50:17.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纽约那个巨大的虫洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That giant wormhole, in um, in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.31,0:50:19.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想到了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it remind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.47,0:50:22.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在玩儿我么 我不想谈那件事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's manipulative. I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.75,0:50:24.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外星侵略者还会回来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they coming back? The aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.57,0:50:25.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能会 你别问了好不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, can you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.50,0:50:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我说过我有焦虑症吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when I told you that I have an anxiety issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.77,0:50:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个话题让你很紧张吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this subject make you edgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.73,0:50:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.25,0:50:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能让我喘口气儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I just catch my breath for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.95,0:50:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫瑰山那边也有坏人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there bad guys in Rose Hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要拿塑料袋帮你呼吸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need a plastic bag to breathe into?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.71,0:50:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你带了药吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have medication? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.38,0:50:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你现在要服药吗 - 可能得服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you need to be on it? - Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.79,0:50:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有创伤后遗症吗 - 我并不认为我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have PTSD? - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.28,0:50:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是快要精神病发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going completely mental?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以不问 你想让我停止吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can stop, do you want me to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.85,0:50:49.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了叫你别缠着我问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when I said to stop doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.30,0:50:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 你会把我逼疯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God, you're going to freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.19,0:50:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 你真的把我逼疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah man, you did it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.72,0:50:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你现在开心了 - 我说什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You happy now? - What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.60,0:51:01.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 等等我 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait up! Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.88,0:51:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.66,0:51:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错 你把我逼走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fault, you spazzed me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.68,0:51:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 重回正题 我们刚才说到哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, back to business. Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个死了的人有亲戚吗 他的母亲 戴维斯夫人在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy who died... relatives?Mom? Ms. Davis, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.53,0:51:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她一直没走 - 看 你总算说了句有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where she always is. - See, now you're being helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.55,0:51:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 女士 这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Lady, this uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.17,0:51:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.92,0:51:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发型不错 很适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice haircut, suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.33,0:51:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 手表不错 - 是啊 还是限量版呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice watch. - Yeah, limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.29,0:51:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我毫不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.19,0:51:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上过得愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well have a good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.94,0:52:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴维斯女士 你介意我坐下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms. Davis, Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.40,0:52:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 坐吧 没人拦你 - 确实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Free country. - It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.84,0:52:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.44,0:52:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想从哪里开始说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you like to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.74,0:52:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉您 我对您儿子的事很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to say I'm sorry about your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.05,0:52:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道 到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what you think happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.27,0:52:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带来了你想要的文件 你拿了就走人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought your damn file. You take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.57,0:52:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面乱七八糟的事儿 和他没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever was in here, he wanted no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.44,0:52:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然 你还在等什么别的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly, you were waiting for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.53,0:52:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你约了人在这儿见面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposed to meet somebody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.92,0:52:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.34,0:53:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴维斯女士 你儿子没有自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms. Davis, your son didn't kill himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.95,0:53:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证 他也没杀害任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee you, he didn't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.16,0:53:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是被人利用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone used him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.04,0:53:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么 - 被人当作武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - As a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.12,0:53:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个给我打电话的人 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the person who called me after all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.73,0:53:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是我打了你电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.45,0:53:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 怎么回事 这他妈是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey! What's all this about? what the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.56,0:53:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在逮捕嫌犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called an arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.65,0:53:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是警长吗 - 是的女士 你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sheriff, is it? - Yes ma'am, it is. And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.87,0:53:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是国土安全局的 没问题了吧 - 不 有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Homeland Security. We good here? - No, we're not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.46,0:53:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好说得详细点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a little more information than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.76,0:53:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还轮不着你来质询我 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think it's a little above your pay grade, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.19,0:53:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 你怎么不去纳什维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, why don't you get on the horn to Nashville
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:53:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我办个升职？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and upgrade me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.58,0:53:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, you know what,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.49,0:54:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想耍点聪明把这事解决了 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping to do this the smart way, but uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.20,0:54:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想玩真的 我也没意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fun way's always good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.21,0:54:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警士 把这个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deputy, get this woman and...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.27,0:54:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辣妹要派对么 那就来吧 我陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey hot wings, you wanna party? Come on, you and me, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.50,0:54:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真疯狂 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Crazy, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.05,0:54:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.20,0:55:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己找上门来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walked right into this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.49,0:55:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我泡过比你更热辣的妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've dated hotter chicks than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.57,0:55:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这点能耐？ 廉价把戏和俗套冷笑话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all you got? Cheap trick and a cheesy one-liner?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.89,0:55:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甜心 我自传可能就以那个为题写了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, that could be the name of my autobiography.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.79,0:57:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 放我走! - 救命! 救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me go! - Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.22,0:57:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子 你圣诞节想要什么礼物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey kid, what would you like for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.22,0:57:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.35,0:57:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 他意思是"我要那个天杀的文件"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I think he was trying to say "I want my goddamn file."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.97,0:57:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.21,0:57:22.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得欺负你的同学吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what I told you about bullies?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.03,0:57:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何？ 聪明人都这么办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that, West World? That's the thing about smart guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总能自保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always cover our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.25,0:57:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用谢哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.37,0:58:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么不用谢？ - 我可救了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what? Did I miss something?  - Me saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.48,0:58:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我先救的你 然后 还是谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A: Saved you first. B: Thanks, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.10,0:58:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后 提个建议 帮了人也别嚷嚷好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And C: If you do someone a solid, don't be a yutz alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淡定点 不然你就掉大价了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just play it cool otherwise you come off grandiose.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.17,0:58:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也这样么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.65,0:58:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承认吧 你需要我 我们心有灵犀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admit it, you need me. We're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.99,0:58:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要你回家 和你妈待一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I need is for you to go home, be with your mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.17,0:58:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管好你的嘴 守好战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keep your trap shut, and guard the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.88,0:58:27.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时保持电话联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And stay connected to the telephone because
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.21,0:58:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一打电话你就接 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I call you better pick up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.38,0:58:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感受到了吗 这儿没我们事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel that? We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.15,0:58:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挪开 不然会被车碾到 再见 小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move out of the way or I'm going to run you over. Bye kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.89,0:58:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 孩子 你做的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry kid. You did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.61,0:58:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是要抛弃我么 跟我爸一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now you're just going to leave me here, like my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.11,0:58:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 等等 你想让我觉得内疚是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Wait, you're guilt-tripping me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.83,0:58:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来 你猜我怎么看出来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell. You know how I can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.34,0:59:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们心有灵犀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause we're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.97,0:59:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是值得一试的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.41,0:59:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个并不贵 又特别漂亮 简直是百…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get this. It's affordable. It's gorgeous. It goes with any deco...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.19,0:59:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影像怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.15,0:59:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是怎么了？ - 整个洛杉矶都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is this happening again? - Fine. Override to Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.39,0:59:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个东海岸 卫星都沦陷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire East coast.. the satellites are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.81,0:59:42.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接到了一个不明广播信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an unauthorized broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,副总统先生 您可能需要看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Vice President, I think you should see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.50,0:59:49.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦我的神 又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.67,0:59:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统能看到这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the President getting this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.97,1:00:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.29,1:00:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两课要讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only two lessons remain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.75,1:00:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想在圣诞节前结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to finish this before Christmas morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.75,1:00:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是汤姆斯·理查德 好名字 工作也很出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet Thomas Richards. Good strong name, good strong job.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.53,1:00:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆斯是劳克斯石油公司的会计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas here is an accountant for the Roxxon Oil Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.61,1:00:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也确认他是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm sure he's a really good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.51,1:00:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我待会要爆掉他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to shoot him in the head,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.83,1:00:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30秒后枪杀他 等着看直播吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}live on your television, in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.30,1:00:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你手机里有这部电话的号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The number for this telephone is in your cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.90,1:00:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振奋人心是不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.23,1:00:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想就激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagining how it got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.45,1:00:46.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人 如果你们的总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America, if your president
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.25,1:00:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30秒内打电话给我 汤姆就不用死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calls me in the next half-minute, Tom lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.21,1:00:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.41,1:00:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么黑进我手机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he hack my phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.87,1:00:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能任由恐怖分子为所欲为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't allow terrorists to dictate
