Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.89,1:00:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我强烈反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd strongly advise against that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.43,1:01:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.17,1:01:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来只有一课了 埃利斯总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's just one lesson left, President Ellis,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.56,1:01:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快逃难吧 和你的孩子们吻别吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so run away and kiss your children goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.83,1:01:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为任何东西 包括你的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because nothing, not your army,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.51,1:01:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括你的钢铁战狗 都救不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not your red, white, and blue attack dog, can save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.27,1:01:42.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快会再相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.38,1:01:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命令罗迪 现在就找到这个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Rhodes, find this lunatic right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.02,1:01:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我们追踪了广播信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we tracked the broadcast signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.67,1:01:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号源地可能在巴基斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a possible point of origin in Pakistan
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.97,1:01:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢铁爱国者随时待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Patriot is ready to strike.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.24,1:01:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在行动! - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right now! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.29,1:02:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.37,1:02:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.98,1:02:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到过这么个小妞么 仔细看她时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have a chick striking you and you look up and so then she
