Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.99,1:02:45.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 遇到过 你是？ - 是我 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I've had that. Who is this? - It's me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.36,1:02:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次我失踪时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now last time I went missing,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:48.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没记错的话 你好像有事找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I remember correctly, you came looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.71,1:02:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在干吗 - 聊聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - A little talking,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.65,1:02:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和巴基斯坦人交交朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making friends in Pakistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.65,1:02:52.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干吗呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.64,1:02:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的新形象是AIM设计的对吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your re-design, your big re-brand, that was AIM, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.51,1:03:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找颗卫星 告诉我你的登陆账号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna find a heavy-duty comsat right now, I need your login.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.64,1:03:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前一样 战争机器68\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same as it's always been, WarMachine68.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.80,1:03:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,密码多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And password please?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.75,1:03:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我换了 你黑一次我就得改一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look, I gotta change it every time you hack in, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.33,1:03:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是80年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the eighties,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.20,1:03:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不流行"黑"了 报上新账户名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody says "Hack" Anymore, give me your login.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.27,1:03:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争机器最酷 全大写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"WARMACHINEROX" with an X, all caps.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.43,1:03:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 - 哈哈 比钢铁爱国者顺耳多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah okay.  - Hahah That is so much better than Iron Patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好很好 我有一个问题给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice. Very nice. I have one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.98,1:03:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今年圣诞节想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you like for Christmas this year?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.68,1:03:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴维 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, David, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.84,1:04:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网速太慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.90,1:04:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 先生 我不知道你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me sir, I don't know who...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.75,1:04:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈 我得挂了 奇迹发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I need to call you back. Something magical is happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.07,1:04:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 托尼·斯塔克在我面包车里 - 小点声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony Stark is in my van. - Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.28,1:04:20.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 托尼·斯塔克在我面包车里 - 不 他不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony Stark is in my van! - No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.90,1:04:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you were still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来 把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in and close the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.79,1:04:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以恕我直言吗先生 - 说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow, can I just say sir? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.95,1:04:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的铁杆粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.83,1:04:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先问下 这是你的车吗 有其他人要进来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, first, is this your van or is anyone else gonna come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.37,1:04:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 就咱俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's just us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.90,1:04:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.58,1:04:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 盖里 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gary. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.84,1:04:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.62,1:04:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 这种情况我常遇到 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right that's fine. I get a lot of this, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.92,1:04:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能恕我直言吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.52,1:04:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 说 - 不知道你看出来没 但是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - I don't know if you can tell but I have like
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.01,1:04:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造型全向你看齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patterned my whole look after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.22,1:04:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但头发不好 又没用护发品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hair is just a little, it's not right. Just no product in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.44,1:04:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.36,1:05:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你觉得尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to make things awkward for you
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 对的 - 但我还要让你看 嘣!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - But I do have to show you... boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西班牙版斯科特·拜奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hispanic Scott Baio?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.04,1:05:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦对不起 是我吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I'm sorry, is that me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.81,1:05:12.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让人照着我做的一个公仔刺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... I mean. I had them do it off a doll that I made,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.58,1:05:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像用照片做参考 所以有点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it's not like it's off a picture. So it's a little bit-
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.64,1:05:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖里 现在听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary, for a moment, listen to me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.17,1:05:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想打击你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to clip your wings here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.81,1:05:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但咱俩确实兴奋过头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both a little over-excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.21,1:05:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事儿办 在追查坏人 但同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an issue. I'm chasing bad guys, trying to
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.79,1:05:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要先从机密数据库里弄点资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grapple with something from some hard-crypt data files.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.97,1:05:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是信号不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have enough juice.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.27,1:05:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你去车顶 调一下网络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to jump on the roof, recalibrate the ISDNs.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.94,1:05:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提速40%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pump it up by about 40%.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.09,1:05:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白啦 - 好的 这是交你的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it.  - Alright, it's a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.57,1:05:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼需要盖里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony needs Gary.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.72,1:05:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖里也需要托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Gary needs Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.76,1:05:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要声张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quiet about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.32,1:05:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.80,1:06:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生命中最意义非凡的一刻是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you regard as the defining moment of your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.68,1:06:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那一定是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well uh, I think that would be
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.10,1:06:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定不再受伤痛折磨的那一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the day I decided not to let my injury beat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.94,1:06:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能对着镜头说出你的名字吗 - 艾伦·布兰特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you please state your name for the camera? - Ellen Brant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.63,1:06:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将对你进行周期性注射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so, the injections are administered periodically.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.74,1:06:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁止药物上瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Addiction will not be tolerated and
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.17,1:06:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制不住药瘾的将离开项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those who cannot regulate will be cut from the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.42,1:06:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经是边缘人 残疾人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once misfits, cripples...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.94,1:06:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在起 你们会是人类进化的优胜者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the next iteration of human evolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.63,1:06:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家伙儿 在开始前 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi everybody. Before we start, I promise you,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.06,1:06:43.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你回顾人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking back at your life there will be
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.68,1:06:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为第一批实验人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing as bitter as the memory of
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.70,1:06:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中的艰苦和荣耀都会让你永生难忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that glorious risk that you prudently elected to forego.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.67,1:06:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们今天很光荣 开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today is your glory. Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.91,1:07:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶紧出去 赶紧出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here! Gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.01,1:07:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他们出去 带他们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get 'em out! Get 'em out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.41,1:07:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是炸弹的炸弹 原来就是人肉炮弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bomb is not a bomb when it's a misfire.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.22,1:07:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西不是每次都奏效 对吧 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stuff doesn't always work, right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有缺陷 但你找到了买家 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's faulty, but you found a buyer, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.28,1:07:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卖给了曼达林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sold it to the Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.89,1:07:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 发生了什么 - 有趣的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened?  - Fun fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.36,1:07:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为纳粹造火箭前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before he built rockets for the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.63,1:07:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位理想主义者 沃纳·冯·布劳恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The idealistic Werner von Braun
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.24,1:07:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦想过太空旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dreamed of space travel.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.45,1:07:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stargazed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.54,1:07:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道第一枚V2火箭击中伦敦时他说了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he said when the first V2 hit London?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.04,1:07:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火箭表现完美无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rocket performed perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.50,1:07:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜落在了错误的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just landed on the wrong planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.15,1:08:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 我们一开始很天真 只是纯粹的科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, we all begin wide-eyed... "Pure science".
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.61,1:08:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着自我开始膨胀 变得偏执\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the ego steps in, the obsession
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.46,1:08:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你回头看时 已经走得太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you look up, you're a long way from shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.44,1:08:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太苛责自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be too hard on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.03,1:08:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛雅 是智囊团利用了你的研究成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maya. I mean you gave your research to a think tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.61,1:08:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但基里安的智囊团和军方本就是合作关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but Killian built that think tank on military contracts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.38,1:08:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前也这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what we used to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.93,1:08:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别苛求自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't judge yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.47,1:08:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.70,1:08:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.24,1:08:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.10,1:08:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚上好 - 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening. - Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.24,1:08:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛雅 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maya, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.87,1:08:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.18,1:08:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不想告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want to tell me
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.89,1:09:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚为什么去斯塔克家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why you were at Stark's manison last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.35,1:09:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要解决问题 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to fix this thing. I didn't
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.84,1:09:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟老大要把那里炸掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}know you and the Master were gonna blow the place up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.08,1:09:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 你想救斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I see, so you were trying to save Stark
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.64,1:09:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕他威胁我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he threatened us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.90,1:09:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你 我们可以利用他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Killian, we can use him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.58,1:09:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀 珮珀 珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper, Pepper, Pepper
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.70,1:09:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果明年要推新品就需要斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look if we want to launch product next year, I need Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.71,1:09:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不过是缺少动机 现在他有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just lacked a decent incentive. Now he has one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.92,1:09:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是蓝0支援组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Support Team Blue 0,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.92,1:09:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已发送疑似曼达林视频信号来源地坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sending coordinates for suspected Mandarin broadcast point of origin.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.38,1:09:31.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.47,1:09:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蓝0队 除非曼达林下次袭击美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Support Blue 0, unless the Mandarin's next attack on the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.57,1:09:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用到廉价运动服 不然我认为你们又搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}involves cheaply-made sportswear, I think you messed up again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.00,1:09:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们自由了 看来之前不是自由身 是的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you're free, if you weren't before. Yes ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.41,1:10:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢铁爱国者为您服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron Patriot on the job, happy to help,no
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.83,1:10:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用谢 这是我应该做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}need to thank me, it's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.01,1:10:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赛文 我拿到了爱国者战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savin, I've acquired the Patriot armor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.31,1:10:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要这件战衣吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want this suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.33,1:10:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你把我的尸体从里面拖出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to have to pry my cold, dead body out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.28,1:10:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么想的 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the plan, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.29,1:10:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 告诉我怎么样了 说详细点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harley, tell me what is happening, give me a full report.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.94,1:10:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在吃糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm still eating that candy,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.31,1:10:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让我继续吃吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you want me to keep eating it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.68,1:10:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃了多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.64,1:10:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两三碗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two or three bowls.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.59,1:10:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看得清东西吗 - 勉强可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you still see straight?  - Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.49,1:10:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那说明你没事 把电话给贾维斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means you're fine, give me Jarvis.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.36,1:10:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, how are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.49,1:10:38.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 一切正常 不过前句能好好说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's totally fine sir. I seem to do quite well for a stretch and
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.29,1:10:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后句再说就会出错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then at the end of the sentence I say the wrong cranberry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.56,1:10:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人 你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sir, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.40,1:10:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在对AIM的卫星接收设备进行分析后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I factored in available AIM downlink facilities
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.21,1:10:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我成功定位了曼达林视频的来源地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was able to pinpoint the Mandarin's broadcast signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.70,1:10:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪？ 远东 欧洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're we talkin'? The Far East, Europe,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.16,1:10:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北非 伊朗 巴基斯坦 叙利亚 到底在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North Africa, Iran, Pakistan, Syria, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.17,1:10:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实在迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, sir, it's in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.64,1:10:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, kid, I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.47,1:10:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要教你重启贾维斯的语音驱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have to walk you through rebooting Jarvis's speech drive,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.02,1:10:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.67,1:11:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 他到底在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harley, where is he really?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.82,1:11:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着屏幕 告诉我他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look on the screen and tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.40,1:11:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实在佛罗里达州的迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...it does say Miami, Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.36,1:11:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 先说重要的 我需要战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, first things first, I need the armor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.39,1:11:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它现在什么状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we at with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.54,1:11:10.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's not charging.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.15,1:11:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人 它其实正在充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, sir, it is charging,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.08,1:11:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是电源好像有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the power source is questionable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.40,1:11:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能无法让42代恢复活力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may not succeed in revitalizing the Mark 42.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.94,1:11:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电源有什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's questionable about electricity?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.52,1:11:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的战衣 我不能 我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, it's my suit and I can't... I'm not gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.06,1:11:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦天呐 又来了 - 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh God, not again.  - Tony
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.79,1:11:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又发病了吗 我根本没提纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you having another attack? I didn't even mention New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 可你刚刚又说了这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, and then you just said it,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.40,1:11:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说没提的时候你又说了一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by name, while denying having said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.82,1:11:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, um, uh.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.74,1:11:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God, what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.03,1:11:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸 深呼吸就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just breathe, really just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.23,1:11:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是个机械师 对吗 - 对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're a mechanic, right?  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.77,1:11:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这么说的对吧 - 是 我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said so.  - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.76,1:12:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不造点东西呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What don't you just build something?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.60,1:12:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.86,1:12:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.86,1:14:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这么热 说过要你把空调打到20度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it so hot in here? I told you to put it at 68.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.35,1:14:10.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怪我了 告诉你吧 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fault again. Let me tell you something sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.04,1:14:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能随便使唤…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not your personal...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.52,1:15:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真臭 20分钟内我是不会再去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't go in there for twenty minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.46,1:15:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们两个谁是瓦内莎 - 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, which one of you is Vanessa?  - That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.37,1:15:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 小莎莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Nessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.68,1:15:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 幸运饼不是中国产的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that fortune cookies aren't even Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.60,1:15:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边有个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some guy over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.20,1:15:34.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是美国人用日本配方做的 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're made by Americans, based on the Japanese recipes.  - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.04,1:15:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody hell. Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.55,1:15:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别动 - 我不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't move.  - I am not moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.47,1:15:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要什么就拿吧 这些枪都是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want something, take it, although the guns are all fake
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.14,1:15:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那些混蛋不敢给我真枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because those wankers wouldn't trust me with the real ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.00,1:15:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 那要不把这俩妞带走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Hey, do you fancy either of the birds?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.95,1:15:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 你不是曼达林 真的在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard enough. You're not him, the Mandarin, the real guy, where?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.77,1:15:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 曼达林在哪儿 他在哪儿 - 他在这儿 他在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the Mandarin? Where is he?  - He's here. He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.34,1:15:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他又不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.29,1:16:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在这儿但又不在这儿 - 你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's here but he's not here.  - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.66,1:16:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很复杂 很复杂的 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's complicated, hey, it's complicated, alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.70,1:16:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗 - 挺复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is?  - It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.62,1:16:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就简单点说 女人都下床 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncomplicate it. Ladies out, get out of the bed,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到厕所去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.64,1:16:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.90,1:16:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫特雷弗 特雷弗·斯莱特利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Trevor, Trevor Slattery.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.20,1:16:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.58,1:16:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是诱饵还是替身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you, a decoy? You're a double, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.08,1:16:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不是替身 绝对不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No. An understudy? Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.18,1:16:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请别伤害我 我只是个演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt me please! I'm an actor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.64,1:16:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你多活一分钟 把话说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a minute to live, fill it with words.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.84,1:16:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个角色而已 "曼达林"不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a role. "The Mandarin", see, it's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.27,1:16:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么到这来的 特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how did you get here, Trevor?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.34,1:16:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我喜欢嗑点那啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, well, uh, I have a little problem with, um, substances,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.62,1:16:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就做了些坏事 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I ended up doing things... no two ways about it
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.92,1:16:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当街做了些坏事 - 然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the street that a man shouldn't do.  - Next!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.93,1:17:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们找到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, they approached me
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.68,1:17:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说了角色 他们也知道我有毒瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the role and they knew about the drugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.42,1:17:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是要帮你戒毒咯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd they say they'd get you off them?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.74,1:17:06.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说会给我更多毒品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said they'd give me more.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.41,1:17:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们给我很多东西 比如这座宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave me things. They gave me this palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.19,1:17:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我整了容 反正就是给我东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave me plastic surgery. They gave me things.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.51,1:17:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道睡着了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just nod off?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.82,1:17:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没 还有艘美翻了的快艇 最主要的原因是他需要有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the lovely speedboat! And the thing was, he needed someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.42,1:17:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来承担这些"意外爆炸事件"的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To take credit for some "Accidental explosions".
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.75,1:17:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He"?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.38,1:17:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 基里安么？ - 对 基里安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Killian?  - Killian.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.36,1:17:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他创造了你？ - 嗯他创造了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He created you? - He created me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.92,1:17:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 恐吓也是他们炮制的 - 对头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Custom-made terror threat.  - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.75,1:17:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 智囊团设计了这出好戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, his think tank thinked it up,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.76,1:17:46.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设计出变态连环杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the pathology of the serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.21,1:17:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塑造一个极恶份子形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The manipulation of Western iconography.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.56,1:17:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"准备好再上一课了么？" 之类之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ready for another lesson?" Blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.73,1:17:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 是我的表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, it was my performance
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.36,1:17:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让曼达林这角色形象饱满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that brought the Mandarin to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.89,1:18:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的表演？ 真杀了人也是表演？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your performance? Where people die?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.49,1:18:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 你看看周围 戏服 绿屏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, look around you, costumes, green screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.86,1:18:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 我一般没在现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I wasn't on location for half this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.36,1:18:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了现场 就都是电影特效了 亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when I was, movie magic, love.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.54,1:18:15.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不好意思 我有个好友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry but I got a best
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.08,1:18:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在医院里昏迷不醒 性命堪忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}friend who's in a coma and he might not wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.10,1:18:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你扮的曼达林惹的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're going to have to answer for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.31,1:18:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你玩完了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still going down, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.34,1:18:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷弗 你和他说了些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Trevor, what'd you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.66,1:18:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我啥也没说 - 什么都没说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't tell him anything.  - Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.96,1:18:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有 - 你应该按紧急按钮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No.  - You should have pressed the panic button.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.53,1:18:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实紧急 但我自己不是解决了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I panicked, but then I handled it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.50,1:19:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉时光倒流了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like old times, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.20,1:19:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这回还加上了扎带 爽得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah, with zip-ties. It's a ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.31,1:19:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.04,1:19:10.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当年 你拿了基里安的名片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so you took Killian's card
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.98,1:19:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接受了他的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.05,1:19:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今 13年后 你被他关起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here you are 13 years later in a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.64,1:19:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 并不是 - 才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.52,1:19:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是的 被关的是你 我来去自如 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you're in a dungeon. I'm free to go. - Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.32,1:19:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 经历这么多后 我快成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot's happened Tony, and I'm close.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.12,1:19:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终极改造基本稳定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extremis is pratically stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.02,1:19:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.50,1:19:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们在街上被炸飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him on the street, people are going 'bang',
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.12,1:19:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲜血染红了墙 玛雅 你自欺欺人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're painting the walls. Maya, you're kidding yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.30,1:19:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那帮我改好它啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then help me fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.05,1:19:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我写的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.97,1:19:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 我记得那晚 但不记得次日早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes.  - I remember the night, not the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.28,1:19:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在找这个的答案么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what you've been chasing around?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.74,1:19:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不记得了？ - 我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't remember?  - I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.73,1:19:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的你 有道德操守有抱负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to have a moral psychology. You used to have ideals.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.06,1:20:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一心想要帮人 但现在 看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanted to help people, now look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.17,1:20:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是 每天躺我身边陪我醒来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get to wake up every morning with someone who...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.16,1:20:11.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still has a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.75,1:20:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我弄出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.44,1:20:22.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.67,1:20:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 我老爸以前总和我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what my old man used to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.44,1:20:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of his favorite of many sayings.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.00,1:20:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"早起的鸟儿有虫吃 第二只老鼠才能得到奶酪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The early bird gets the worm, the second mouse gets the cheese".
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.48,1:20:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是因为瑞士的事生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not still pissed about the Switzerland thing, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.86,1:20:38.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会生你的气呢 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I be pissed at you, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.31,1:20:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我专门来谢你的 你给了我最棒的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to thank you. You've given me the greatest gift
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.52,1:20:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比啥礼物都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that anybody's ever given me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.56,1:20:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是绝望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.53,1:20:48.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初在瑞士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think back to Switzerland,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.17,1:20:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说的 你说跟我在房顶见 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you said you'd meet me on the rooftop, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.40,1:20:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等了20分钟后 我还觉得你会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well for the first 20 minutes, I actually thought you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.92,1:20:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后又一个小时过去 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the next hour, I uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.17,1:21:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想过跨出那一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I considered taking that one step
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.45,1:21:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接空降大厅 懂我意思吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shortcut to the lobby, if you know I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.34,1:21:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 我还在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I'm still trying to
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.74,1:21:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一只老鼠为啥吃不到奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}figure out what happened to the first mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.90,1:21:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但当我俯瞰城市 没人知道我在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I looked out over that city, nobody knew I was there,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.78,1:21:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能看到我 甚至都没人在看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody could see me, no one was even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.40,1:21:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个念头油然而生 并伴随了我这么些年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a thought that would guide me for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.02,1:21:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐匿自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anonymity, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.83,1:21:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你 从那以后我就把它当成行事准则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you, it's been my mantra ever since, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.84,1:21:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只隐藏在背后当推手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You simply rule from behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.34,1:21:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为一旦你给邪恶安上一张脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the second you give evil a face
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.79,1:21:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如本拉登 卡扎菲 曼达林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bin Laden, Gaddafi, The Mandarin
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.42,1:21:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是众矢之的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hand the people a target.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.72,1:21:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.39,1:21:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见过他了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have met him, I assume?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.53,1:21:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 混世大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Sir Lawrence Oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.16,1:21:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他偶尔有些夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he's a little over the top sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.47,1:21:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这又不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not entirely my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.72,1:21:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舞台演员都有点夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a tend...he's a stage actor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.52,1:21:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说他演李尔王在克罗伊登很卖座 谁知道哪儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say his Lear was the toast of Croydon, wherever that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.73,1:21:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 自从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, the point is ever since
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.40,1:21:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷神都手持锤子从天而降了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that big dude with the hammer fell out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.10,1:22:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持低调实在是没必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subtlety's kinda had its day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.16,1:22:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接下来有什么打算？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's next for you in your world?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.66,1:22:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想报答你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I wanted to repay you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.67,1:22:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回赠谢礼 回应你当年善意的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the same gift you so graciously imparted to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.78,1:22:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.65,1:22:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是现场直播的 能看出来么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is live. I'm not sure if you can tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.11,1:22:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在她的身体在决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at this moment the body is trying to decide
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.85,1:22:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是否接受终极改造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether to accept Extremis or just give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.68,1:22:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it gives up,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.23,1:22:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不说 爆炸会特别壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to say the detonation is quite spectactular.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.36,1:22:36.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在那之前 确实会很疼很疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But until that point, it's really just a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.48,1:22:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没谈工资的事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't even talked salary yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.44,1:22:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么福利？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of perk package are you thinking of?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.18,1:22:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.52,1:22:49.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.22,1:22:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛雅 - 我说了放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maya.  - I said let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.18,1:22:54.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.56,1:22:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1200毫升 只要一半我就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1200ccs, a dose half of this size and I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.14,1:23:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她这不是考验我的暴脾气么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's times like this my temper is tested somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.51,1:23:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛雅 注射器给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maya, give me the injector.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.06,1:23:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基里安 要是我死了 你的士兵们怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I die Killian, what happens to your soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.42,1:23:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的产品怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens to your product?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.51,1:23:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能这么干 好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not doing this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.71,1:23:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么办？ 你要是过热了怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens to you? What happens if you go too hot?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.46,1:23:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息 一个高层职位刚空了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The good news is, a high level position has just been vacated.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.29,1:23:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这个疯子 - 不是的 我是个有远见的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're a maniac.  - No, I'm a visionary.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.18,1:23:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我掌控着一个疯子 他今晚即将登台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do own a maniac, and he takes the stage tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.89,1:23:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦把钢铁爱国者安插进飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get the Iron Patriot installed,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.23,1:23:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九到十分钟就可以把事情解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll take me nine to ten minutes for a take down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.36,1:23:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.30,1:23:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还有人在战衣里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I looked there was somebody inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.15,1:24:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午好 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afternoon, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.79,1:24:11.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.54,1:24:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.27,1:24:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把你弄出来的 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get you out of there, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.91,1:24:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样会破坏战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll damage the armor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.63,1:24:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 但你能修好 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I will, but you can fix it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.73,1:24:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会带着这套战衣回基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to take the suit up to base camp,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.91,1:24:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把珮珀带上跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want Potts with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.23,1:24:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还在第二阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still in Phase 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.40,1:24:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没变聋吧 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going deaf, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.99,1:24:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻拿轻放 那可是限量版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful there. It's a limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.58,1:25:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我说马尾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, ponytail express.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.31,1:25:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 田纳西和迈阿密的距离有多少 - 832英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is the mileage count between Tennessee and Miami?  - 832 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.77,1:25:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.13,1:25:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就这么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.15,1:25:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能不让它叫唤吗 - 弄坏了就得赔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you, uh, stop that? - Break it you bought it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.45,1:25:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我赔吧 - 好吧 那不是我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I bought it.  - Okay, that wasn't mine to give away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.37,1:25:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我朋友妹妹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That belongs to my friend's sister,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.69,1:25:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我最先会干掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's why I'm gonna kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.55,1:25:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你打算怎么做 - 你会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What're ya gonna do to me?  - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.91,1:25:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被绑在床上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're zip-tied to a bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.26,1:25:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.94,1:25:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.82,1:25:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要出来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you comin' out?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.11,1:25:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打开 别打开 别开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not open. Do not open. Don't open.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.49,1:25:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开 别 好吧 那来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't open. Don't... Alright, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.48,1:25:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还喷火 成吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You breathe fire? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.48,1:26:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美好的一天啊 赛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a glorious day, Savin.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.20,1:26:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天这个时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.35,1:26:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将一手掌握西方国家最有权利的领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the West's most powerful leader in one hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.91,1:26:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一手则控制最令人畏惧的恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the world's most feared terrorist in the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.92,1:26:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将拥有恐怖战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll own the War on Terror,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.54,1:26:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你和你的兄弟姊妹创造需求 提供供给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creates supply and demand for you and your brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.49,1:26:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 你将倒在自己的血泊中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. You're going in a puddle of blood on the ground
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.13,1:26:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒数5 4 3 快来啊 2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in 5, 4, 3. Come on! 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.30,1:26:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底怎么摊上这货的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did we get this shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.57,1:26:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我是在给你逃跑的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I'm going to give you a chance to escape,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.25,1:26:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下你的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put down your weapons,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.10,1:26:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再把自己绑在椅子上 我就不杀你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tie yourselves into those chairs. I'll let you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.38,1:26:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒数5 4 砰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 5, 4. Ban!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.26,1:26:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩应该早闪开的 你们真的该闪人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be gone by now. You should have already been gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.07,1:26:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是被你吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just beyond terrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.92,1:26:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.47,1:26:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,3 4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.11,1:26:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴 - 54321\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. - 54321.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.64,1:26:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.93,1:27:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the rest?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.58,1:28:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我讨厌在这里工作 他们都太奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I hate working here. They are so weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.36,1:28:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来得还不算太晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.57,1:28:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不要 别打脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time. Not the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.41,1:28:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼 能回来真好 你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phew, it's good to be back. Hello, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.38,1:28:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hello sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.97,1:28:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员注意 斯塔克已脱逃 正在基地某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, Stark is loose and somewhere in the compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.63,1:28:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次 斯塔克已脱逃 正在基地某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat. Stark is loose and somewhere in the compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.25,1:28:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.23,1:28:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.40,1:28:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 托尼 - 罗迪 是你在飞那战衣么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony.  - Rudy, tell me that was you in the suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.85,1:28:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 你拿到你的了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you got yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.39,1:29:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 差不多吧 尽快去主屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, um, kind of. Main house as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.07,1:29:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让你见一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody I'd like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.01,1:29:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 你 你 闪开 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, you, you. Move! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.57,1:29:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屋子安全了 我在看着曼达林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The room is secure. I have eyes on the Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.17,1:29:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这是啥 赢家拿着的球拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this? I have winner's.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.78,1:29:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这演的是谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What've you come as?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.84,1:29:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敢动一下 我就打烂你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make a move and I'll break your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.74,1:29:31.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想过会有人伤亡 他们骗了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought people had been hurt. They lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.84,1:29:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这货竟然是曼达林？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Mandarin?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.82,1:29:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你意思 这 确实挺丢人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, it's, it's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.00,1:29:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我叫特雷弗 特雷弗·斯莱特利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Trevor, Trevor Slattery.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.94,1:29:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真人比电视里矮小些 大家都这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm shorter in person, a bit small, everyone says that but, uh
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.73,1:29:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 如果你是来逮捕我的 我倒是有几个角色想尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if you're here to arrest me, there are some people who I'd like to roll on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.95,1:29:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况是这样的 梅姨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's how it works, Meryl Streep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.36,1:29:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉他珮珀在哪里 他就会停下那事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell him where Pepper is and he'll stop doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.14,1:29:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥事儿 嗷 我懂了 嗷 疼死了 我懂了 我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doing what? Oh, I get it! Ow! That hurt! I get it! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.60,1:29:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道啥珮珀 但我清楚其他计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know about any Pepper, but I know about the plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.30,1:29:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 说 - 你知道他们拿我的战衣干什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spill.  - Do you know what they did to my suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.77,1:30:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不 不过我知道海边会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?  No.  But I do know what's happening off the coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.08,1:30:06.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有关一个 嗯 一条大船 我可以带你过去哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something to do with uh... A big boat. I can take you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.61,1:30:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 我对上帝发誓 我要开了这家伙的脑瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, I swear to God, I'm going to blow his face off.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.84,1:30:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 可能还涉及副总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh this next bit may include the Vice President as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.22,1:30:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个重要吗 - 有一点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that, is that important?  - Somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.16,1:30:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 就一点儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.61,1:30:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后呢 - 我们怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So?  - Uh, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.85,1:30:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有任何交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have any transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.07,1:30:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 林戈 你刚才是不是提到了什么很炫的快艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ringo, didn't you say something about a "Lovely speedboat"?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.63,1:30:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他地点没说错的话 再过20分钟就能见到珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's right about the location, we are 20 minutes from where Pepper is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.15,1:30:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也得搞明白副总统的事 对不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we also have to figure out this Vice President thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.96,1:30:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正纳闷我在给谁打电话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder who I'm calling right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.08,1:30:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 是给副总统 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, that's the Vice President.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.50,1:30:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 - 先生 我是托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello.  - Sir, this is Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.70,1:30:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回到活人世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back to the land of the living.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.40,1:30:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们确信 您会卷入曼达林的阴谋之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe you're about to be drawn into the Mandarin campaign,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.70,1:30:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以会尽快送您到安全地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we've got to get you somewhere safe as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.52,1:30:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生 我马上要去吃蜂蜜烤火腿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, I'm about to eat honey roast ham
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.09,1:31:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周围全是局里最好的探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounded by the agency's finest.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.39,1:31:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而总统和罗迪上校一起 在空军一号机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the President is safe on Air Force One with Colonel Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.88,1:31:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无需担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're good here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.79,1:31:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 我就是罗迪上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, this is Colonel Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.04,1:31:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把钢铁爱国者当特洛伊木马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're using the Iron Patriot as a Trojan horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.32,1:31:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想除掉总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna take out the President somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.77,1:31:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要马上警告空军一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to immediately alert that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.45,1:31:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我这就去 我会让安全局锁定位置的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm on it. I'll have security lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.68,1:31:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要 F22机半分钟内就能起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If need be, they can have F22s in the air in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.89,1:31:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗迪 斯塔克结束通话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhodes and Stark out.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.25,1:31:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好吗 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.08,1:31:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.93,1:31:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.99,1:31:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗迪上校 看见你能赶来真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Rhodes. Glad to see you could make it, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.20,1:31:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我立刻就觉得安全多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel safer already.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.90,1:32:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做个决定 从总统和珮珀里选一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta make a decision. We can either save the President or Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.83,1:32:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们救不了俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't do both.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.54,1:32:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我收到马里布港那边最新消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I have an update from Malibu.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.62,1:32:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起重机终于到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cranes have finally arrived
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.21,1:32:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在掀开地下室的房顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the cellar doors are being cleared as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.03,1:32:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我正在穿的战衣怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about the suit I'm wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.48,1:32:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机身已经充电至92%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The armor is now at 92%.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.42,1:32:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能凑合上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gonna have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.86,1:32:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他来了 他来了 快给我照一张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here he comes, here he comes, get a quick picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.17,1:32:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事吗 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything all right, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.75,1:33:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸见到你 总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an honor, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.11,1:33:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想杀我 就赶紧动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna do it, do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.17,1:33:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 冷静点儿 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woh. Cool your boots, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.48,1:33:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曼达林可不是这么做事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not how the Mandarin works.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.05,1:33:33.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 空军一号遇袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. Air Force One's been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.75,1:33:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内部枪击 气温上涨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Internal shots, temperature spikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.64,1:33:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻给我影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me eyes on it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.11,1:33:38.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视频正在传送 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Image coming through now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.51,1:33:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是罗迪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that Rhodes?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.15,1:34:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统在哪儿 快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.66,1:34:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.69,1:34:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去喷射气流找吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the jet stream.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.63,1:34:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个 钓鱼去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of which, go fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.44,1:34:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那儿闪开 你个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk away from that, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.69,1:35:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 天上有几个 - 13个 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many in the air?  - Thirteen, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.75,1:35:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能扛几个 - 4个 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many can I carry?  - Four, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.18,1:35:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱动 别动 放松 你叫什么 希瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down, slow down. Relax, what's your name? Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.31,1:35:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 看到那人了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, see that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.69,1:35:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会从他边上飞过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna swing by him
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.95,1:35:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你趁机抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're just gonna grab him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.55,1:35:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.99,1:35:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会电麻你的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will electrify your arm,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.79,1:35:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没法松开手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't be able to open your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.85,1:35:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瑟 你能做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do this, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.87,1:35:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很容易对吧 还剩十一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, see? Eleven more to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.23,1:36:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得猴子手拉手的游戏吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that game called Barrel of Monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.64,1:36:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来模仿它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.34,1:36:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是在一万八千英尺的空中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}18,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.01,1:36:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家加油 抓住周围的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, people! Everybody, grab your monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.55,1:36:13.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒 还有一万英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice! 10,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.68,1:36:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有六千英尺 - 加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 6,000 feet. - Come on, people.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.61,1:36:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油 加油 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.65,1:36:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的! - 还有一千尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - 1000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.91,1:36:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四百英尺 两百英尺 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}400 feet. 200 feet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.39,1:36:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是只淘气的猴子 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a tricky monkey, let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.65,1:36:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.10,1:37:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大伙都干得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work guys. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.46,1:37:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很有默契 棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good team effort all around. Go us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.67,1:37:06.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 贾维斯 活儿还没干完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Jarvis, but it's only half done,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.43,1:37:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀还等…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we still gotta get Pepp...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.89,1:37:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意儿从哪冒出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.72,1:37:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 我想听点好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme some good news man.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.03,1:37:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们都安全了 - 上帝保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think they all made it. - Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.80,1:37:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但我没救到总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I missed the President.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.47,1:37:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿着战衣还救不到总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't save the President with the suit,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.19,1:37:26.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么指望不穿它能救珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how are you gonna save Pepper without nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.42,1:37:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 是时候了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, say Jarvis, is it that time?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.69,1:37:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执行"机器人派对"命令吗 主人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "House party" Protocol, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.73,1:37:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.01,1:38:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.55,1:38:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为他会帮你么 他不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think he's gonna help you... he won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.62,1:38:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓你来不只是为了刺激托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having you here is not just to motivate Tony Stark,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.87,1:38:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺难以启齿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's actually more embarrassing than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.84,1:38:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 把你抓来做 呃 - 战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're here as my, um - Trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.05,1:38:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.83,1:38:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生 欢迎登船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.25,1:39:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说过大象坟场吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard of an elephant graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.95,1:39:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两年前的事就是说的这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, two years ago, the elephant in the room was this scow.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.20,1:39:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是劳克斯石油公司的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Roxxon Norco.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.50,1:39:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该记得它曾在彭萨科拉附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you remember when she
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.85,1:39:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泄漏了一亿加仑石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spilled 100 million gallons of crude off Pensacola.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.46,1:39:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托你的福 没人受法律制裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you, not one fat cat saw a day in court.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.69,1:39:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.30,1:39:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我什么也不做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.06,1:39:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在电视上要一个好理由来杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just needed a reason to kill you that would play well on TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.36,1:39:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 我已经在向前看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I've moved on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.60,1:39:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找了一个新的政治傀儡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've found myself a new political patron, and
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.45,1:39:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天这个时候 他就接替你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this time tomorrow, he'll have your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.39,1:39:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他绑起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}String him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.58,1:39:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.34,1:40:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会吓坏吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna freak out on me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.69,1:40:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.72,1:40:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.73,1:40:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被吊在油罐上方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's strung up over the oil tank,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.98,1:40:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要把他烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're gonna light him up, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.10,1:40:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维京式的葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viking funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.54,1:40:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 公开处决 - 是的 被油烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Public execution.  - Yeah, death by oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.43,1:40:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转播即将开始 各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broadcast will commence shortly. Take final positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.95,1:40:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.16,1:40:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在调出摄像头A至E\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now give me cameras A
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.02,1:40:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来一次完整的彩排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through E and we'll do a full tech rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.23,1:40:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪就位了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your gun up?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.68,1:40:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我该干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.25,1:41:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好我六点钟方向 注意高处 别打到我的背\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on my six, cover high, and don't shoot me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.88,1:41:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身后 高处 不打背 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six, high, back. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.96,1:41:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗 我搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that? Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.92,1:41:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你的确 打碎了蛮多玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you really killed the glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.12,1:41:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我瞄准的是灯泡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was aiming for the bulb?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.27,1:41:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这么远根本打不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hit a bulb from this distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.22,1:41:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没子弹了 你还有弹夹吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out. Gimme, gimme, you got an extra magazine?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.79,1:41:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不通用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not universal, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.13,1:41:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我是做这些的 给我个弹夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I'm doing, I make this stuff. Gimme another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.50,1:41:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你的枪不配套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have one that fits that gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.62,1:41:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有五个弹夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got like five of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.74,1:41:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我接下来要勘查情况了 准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, here's what I'm gonna do. I'm gonna spot. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.22,1:41:36.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.81,1:41:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太快了 什么都没看到 再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too fast, nothing. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.27,1:41:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三男一女 都佩枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three guys, one girl, all armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.08,1:41:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我真需要些武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I'd kill for some armor right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.84,1:41:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 说得对 我们需要后援 - 是的 要很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're right, we need backup. - Yeah, much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.60,1:42:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜怎么着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.62,1:42:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that?  - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.66,1:42:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那些是？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are those? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.05,1:42:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.66,1:42:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 瞄准"终极改造"体的热源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, target Extremis heat signatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.28,1:42:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部清除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disable with extreme prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.70,1:42:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.61,1:42:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在等什么 圣诞到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for? It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.42,1:42:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他们下地狱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 'em to church.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.97,1:43:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 让伊格尔撑住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, get Igor to steady this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.91,1:43:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的闲暇爱好喽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how you've been managing your downtime, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.17,1:43:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都有爱好嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody needs a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.83,1:43:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎心者 去帮帮红鳄龟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heartbreaker? Help Red Snapper out, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.97,1:44:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真准时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.18,1:44:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 太酷了 给我套战衣怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah, that's awesome. Give me a suit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.50,1:44:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉 他们是量身定做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry. They're only coded to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.62,1:44:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.34,1:44:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会掩护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.98,1:44:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚上好上校 能载你一程吗？ - 一点也不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening, Colonel. Can I give you a lift?  - Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.92,1:44:42.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 我已经找到了珮珀小姐 - 是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, I've located Miss Potts. - About time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.92,1:44:57.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停 快把它放下来 放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, put it down, put it down, put it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.36,1:45:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你和我前女友来往的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what happens when you hang out with my ex-girlfriends?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.20,1:45:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.46,1:45:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行 我们晚饭再讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup, we'll talk about it at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.28,1:45:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 宝贝再近一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, a little more, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.18,1:45:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙烦到你了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this guy bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.02,1:45:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.96,1:45:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿热吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it hot there?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.52,1:45:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堵吗 感觉这里堵着吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuck? Feel a little stuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.91,1:45:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像小乌龟 在壳里被活活烤着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a little turtle, cooking in his little turtle suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.82,1:45:48.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.56,1:45:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.23,1:45:52.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好闭上眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.99,1:45:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.28,1:45:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上眼 你不会想看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes. You don't want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.63,1:46:05.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休息一会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.10,1:46:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 现在就给我一套战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, give me a suit right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.03,1:46:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.02,1:46:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生 坚持住 我就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. President! Just hold on, alright? I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.26,1:47:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.37,1:47:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.44,1:47:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.64,1:47:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生 你看起来帅爆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look damn good, Mr. President,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.56,1:47:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得把战衣还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm gonna need that suit back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.55,1:48:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统安全了 托尼 我要撤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President is secure, Tony. I'm clearing the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.68,1:48:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.41,1:48:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了吗 先生？ - 你什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready sir? - What do you mean "Ready"?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.86,1:48:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珮珀 我来了 放松 我在这 看着我就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pep, I got you. Relax, I got you. Just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.16,1:48:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我手只能伸这么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, I can't reach any further,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.44,1:48:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不能呆在那 明白么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can't stay there, alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.48,1:48:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.39,1:48:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得松开手 我会拉住你的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta let go. I'll catch you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.32,1:49:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真丢人呀 是我的话就抓住她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a shame, I would have caught her.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.40,1:49:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弹出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eject.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.02,1:50:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 我们到了屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well here we are, on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.19,1:50:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 42代回程 - 我真够吃惊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark 42 inbound. - Well I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.27,1:50:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浪子回归了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prodigal son returns.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.67,1:50:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.77,1:51:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的配不上她 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really didn't deserve her, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.96,1:51:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在遗憾啊 我就差那么一点就能让她 完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pity. I was so close to having her... perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.50,1:51:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好 等等等等 慢点慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, wait, wait, slow down, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.64,1:51:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 我配不上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I don't deserve her.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.56,1:51:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有一点你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.65,1:51:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她本来就很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was already perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.52,1:51:31.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 帮我个忙 炸掉42代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, do me a favor and blow Mark 42.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.27,1:51:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊啊啊!!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noooo!!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.08,1:52:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再用假面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more false faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.84,1:52:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想要找曼达林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you wanted the Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.06,1:52:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正看着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking right at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.86,1:52:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是我 托尼 从一开始就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always me, Tony, right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.48,1:53:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是曼达林!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the Mandarin!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.68,1:53:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.96,1:53:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾维斯 在我12点方向的对象不是目标 取消目标!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, subject at my 12 o'clock is not a target, disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.94,1:53:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？ 啊怎么了？ 你生我气了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Oh what, are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.36,1:53:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.08,1:54:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.41,1:54:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才真够暴力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was really violent.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.57,1:54:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才吓死我了 我还以为你..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just scared the devil out of me. I thought you were
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.81,1:54:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为我死了 为什么？ 因为我从200英尺高摔下去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was dead. Why? Because I fell two hundred feet?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.26,1:54:21.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在咱俩谁糟糕点？ - 有待商榷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the hot mess now?  - Still debatable.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.80,1:54:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能性有点向你倾斜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably tipping your way a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.94,1:54:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家为什么不这么穿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you dress like this at home?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.46,1:54:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？ 运动文胸 这一整套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm? Sports bra, the whole deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.42,1:54:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道么 我现在明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I think I understand
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.50,1:54:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不愿意放弃你的战衣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why you don't want to give up the suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.81,1:54:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在还能抱怨什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I am gonna complain about now?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.14,1:54:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 有我呢 我会想出办法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's me. I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.18,1:54:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别碰我 别 我会烫伤你的! - 没 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't touch me. No, I'm gonna burn you!  - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.66,1:54:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不烫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.95,1:54:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能变正常么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.89,1:54:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会 你和我在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're in a relationship with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.75,1:54:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都不会正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything will never be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.87,1:54:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想我能搞定这个 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think I can figure this out, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.79,1:54:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我20年前喝醉时差点就能算出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost had this 20 years ago when I was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.51,1:54:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能让你恢复的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can get you better.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.50,1:55:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就干这行的 专事修复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I do. I fix things.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.22,1:55:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你那些让你分心的家伙呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all your distractions?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.89,1:55:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我会稍稍削减他们的数量的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm gonna shave them down a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.27,1:55:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 贾维斯 喂 - 都准备好了先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jarvis, hey. - All wrapped up here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.54,1:55:13.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么要做的么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will there be anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.18,1:55:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.94,1:55:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 执行"清空历史"命令吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "Clean slate" Protocol, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.95,1:55:22.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他的 今天是圣诞 没错 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw it, it's Christmas. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.48,1:56:00.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在呢？ 你喜欢么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay so far? You like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.27,1:56:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.41,1:56:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是 随着圣诞早晨的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, as Christmas morning began,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.12,1:56:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的旅程也到了终点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my journey had reached its end.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.30,1:56:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做一件事 开始时 不带目的 满怀热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You start with something pure, something exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.35,1:56:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而接踵而来的是各种错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then come the mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.88,1:56:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The compromises.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.96,1:56:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们创造自己的魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We create our own Demons".
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.99,1:56:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同我承诺过的 我修理好了珮珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As promised, I got Pepper sorted out.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.20,1:56:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敲打了一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took some tinkering.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.50,1:56:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但之后我又想到 为什么要止步于此？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I thought to myself. Why stop there?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.37,1:57:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然会有人说进步是危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, there are people who say progress is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.68,1:57:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我打赌这群傻子里没一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll bet none of those idiots
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.01,1:57:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾带着满胸腔的弹片活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever had to live with a chest full of shrapnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.62,1:57:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过现在开始… 我也不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now... neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.55,1:57:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你 那是这么多年来我睡得最好的一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you, that was the best sleep I'd had in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.33,1:57:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事的 没事的 - 别!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay, it's okay.  - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.08,1:59:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果要我漂亮地总结一番这故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if I were to wrap this up tight with a bow or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.06,1:59:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说 我的战衣从来不是分心的玩意 也不是爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'd say my armor was never a distraction or a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.70,1:59:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是个茧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.82,1:59:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我破茧而出 焕然一新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I'm a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.60,1:59:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以夺走我的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take away my house,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.83,1:59:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以拿走我的小把戏小玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my tricks and toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.47,1:59:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你夺不走的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing you can't take away...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.00,1:59:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Iron Man.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.49,2:09:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道么 谢谢你听我倾诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, and thank you, by the way, for listening.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.80,2:09:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真的很有用 把郁积心头的话都说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's just something about getting it off my chest
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.99,2:09:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敞开心扉 一吐为快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and putting it out there in the atmosphere instead of holding this in.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.22,2:09:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久郁成疾 你知道么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is what gets people sick, you know?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.86,2:09:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 之前都不知道你这么擅长倾听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, I had no idea you were such a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.21,2:09:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和人分享所有我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be able to share all
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.59,2:09:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想法和经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of my intimate thoughts and my experiences
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.31,2:09:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的压力直降一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with someone, it just cuts the weight of it in half, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.46,2:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像蛇吞咬自己的尾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a snake swallowing its own tail.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.01,2:09:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有事都画上了圆满的圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything comes full circle.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.83,2:09:31.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 而且你还帮我梳理了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...and the fact that you've been able to help me process...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.23,2:09:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那 呃… - 你还在听么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, uh... - You with me?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.42,2:09:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在 呃嗯 我们… 呃 你刚才说到… 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was, yeah. Mm-hmm. We were... uh, we were at, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.39,2:09:38.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡着了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You actively napping?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.85,2:09:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我只是 我…我走神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I was...I... I... I drifted.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.68,2:09:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从什么地方开始的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did I lose you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.78,2:09:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你在瑞士进电梯开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elevator in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.07,2:09:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你什么都没听到？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you heard none of it?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.92,2:09:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 我不是那种医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I'm not that kind of doctor.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.54,2:09:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是治疗师 没受过相关训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a therapist, it's not my training.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.84,2:09:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是？ - 我没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So?  - I don't have the...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.99,2:09:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没什么？ 没时间？ - 那种好脾气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? The time? - Temperament.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.10,2:10:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道么 现在我再回头想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.40,2:10:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢对 我最早的伤疤 1983年 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God my original wound. 1983, alright?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.13,2:10:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.41,2:10:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我都14岁了 还有保姆照看？ 真怪异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 14 years old, I still have a nanny? That was weird.
